goatrope runs, and does not include, tcpdump, ethtool, iproute2 and systemd from
the operating system, and optionally first-bite binaries that the operator
installs and pins.

The goatrope binary includes the goat-transformers reference engine
(github.com/USAREUR-AF/goat-transformers, engines/rust, the commit Cargo.toml
names), Copyright 2025-2026 U.S. Federal Government (in countries where
recognized), Apache License, Version 2.0. It includes no pack and no model
module: the operator installs those and pins them by digest.
